VSP COMPUTED SEGY FILES - RIG SOURCE VSP

Client: Statoil
Well: 15/9-F-11 T2
UTM Zone: 31
Survey: RIG SOURCE VSP
Acquired: 7 May 2013
No. of Files: 41


VSP Processing SEGY-files:
Polarity: AS RECORDED, downgoing compressional arrival is represented as a white trough
	    SLB NORMAL, an increase in A.I. with depth -> -ve number -> white trough

Image SEGY-files:
Polarity: STATOIL NORMAL, an increase in A.I. with depth -> +ve number -> black peak

All segy files present source and receivers coordinates in UTM coordinates



